msgid "It is no longer in this conversation's window."
msgstr "Його вже немає у вікні цієї розмови."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, primary content, after the menu link before a message was clicked.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1019 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:982
msgid "Cannot open the message's menu"
msgstr "Не вдається відкрити меню повідомлення"

#. TRANSLATOR: Submenu of reactions, after the most likely ones.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1083
msgid "More"
msgstr "Ще"

#. TRANSLATOR: Disabled item of the reactions' submenu, in a message's menu.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1090
msgid "No reactions allowed"
msgstr "Реакції не дозволено"

#. TRANSLATOR: Submenu of a message's menu.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1096
msgid "Reactions"
msgstr "Реакції"

#. TRANSLATOR: Tooltip of the paid reaction in a message's menu.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1060
msgid "Spend Telegram Stars on a reaction"
msgstr "Витратити Telegram Stars на реакцію"

#. TRANSLATOR: Paid reaction dialog, title
#: ../td-client.cpp:1188
msgid "Paid reaction"
msgstr "Платна реакція"

#. TRANSLATOR: Paid reaction dialog, primary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:1190
msgid "How many Telegram Stars to spend on this message?"
msgstr "Скільки Telegram Stars витратити на це повідомлення?"

#. TRANSLATOR: Paid reaction dialog, secondary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:1192
msgid "They are spent at once, and cannot be taken back."
msgstr "Їх буде витрачено одразу, і повернути їх не можна."

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat error, when the paid reaction dialog got something other than a number of stars.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1218
#, c++-format
msgid "Not a number of Telegram Stars: {}"
msgstr "Це не кількість Telegram Stars: {}"

#. TRANSLATOR: Tooltip of the link that opens a message's menu. Argument is the message's number.
#: ../client-utils.cpp:1162
#, c++-format
msgid "Menu of message #{}"
msgstr "Меню повідомлення №{}"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of a message's menu; it opens a dialog.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1192
msgid "Edit…"
msgstr "Редагувати…"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of a message's menu; it asks for confirmation.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1204
msgid "Delete for everyone…"
msgstr "Видалити для всіх…"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of a message's menu; it asks for confirmation.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1206
msgid "Delete for me…"
msgstr "Видалити для себе…"

#. TRANSLATOR: Message editing dialog, title
#: ../td-client.cpp:1348
msgid "Edit message"
msgstr "Редагування повідомлення"

#. TRANSLATOR: Message editing dialog, primary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:1350
msgid "New caption of the message"
msgstr "Новий підпис повідомлення"

#. TRANSLATOR: Message editing dialog, primary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:1352
msgid "New text of the message"
msgstr "Новий текст повідомлення"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat error, after a message was edited from its menu; followed by the reason.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1389
msgid "Cannot edit the message"
msgstr "Не вдається змінити повідомлення"

#. TRANSLATOR: Message deletion dialog, title
#: ../td-client.cpp:1404
msgid "Delete message"
msgstr "Видалення повідомлення"

#. TRANSLATOR: Message deletion dialog, primary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:1406
msgid "Delete the message for everyone in the chat?"
msgstr "Видалити повідомлення для всіх у чаті?"

#. TRANSLATOR: Message deletion dialog, primary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:1408
msgid "Delete the message for yourself only?"
msgstr "Видалити повідомлення лише для себе?"

#. TRANSLATOR: Message deletion dialog, secondary content
#: ../td-client.cpp:1410
msgid "This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Цю дію не можна скасувати."

#. TRANSLATOR: Message deletion dialog, alternative is "_Cancel". The underscore marks accelerator keys, they must be different!
#: ../td-client.cpp:1417
msgid "_Delete"
msgstr "_Видалити"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat error, after a message was deleted from its menu; followed by the reason.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1434
msgid "Cannot delete the message"
msgstr "Не вдається видалити повідомлення"

#. TRANSLATOR: After the text of a message edited where it stands, in Pidgin's conversation window.
#: ../receiving.cpp:1274
msgid "edited"
msgstr "змінено"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of a message's menu, while the message is being edited in the input field.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1195
msgid "Cancel editing"
msgstr "Скасувати редагування"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, once editing a message was given up.
#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, after a message being edited was sent unchanged.
#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, after the /cancel command.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1413 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:359 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:818
msgid "The message is left as it was."
msgstr "Повідомлення лишається як було."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error after the /cancel command.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:814
msgid "No message is being edited."
msgstr "Жодне повідомлення не редагується."

#. TRANSLATOR: Command description, the initial "cancel" must remain verbatim!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1094
msgid "cancel: Leave the message being edited as it was"
msgstr "cancel: Лишити редаговане повідомлення як було"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged. Argument is the time (or date and time) the message was sent at, as the conversation window shows it. "/cancel" must remain verbatim!
#: ../td-client.cpp:1364
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"Editing the message from {}: send it to save the change; Esc or /cancel "
"leaves it as it was."
msgstr "Редагування повідомлення від {}: надішліть, щоб зберегти зміну; Esc або /cancel лишає його як було."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, secondary content, when the message has been deleted.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1057
msgid "The message has been deleted."
msgstr "Повідомлення видалено."

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1313
msgid "Strike out deleted messages in Pidgin, rather than remove them"
msgstr "Перекреслювати видалені повідомлення в Pidgin, а не прибирати їх"

#. TRANSLATOR: Check item of an edited message's menu: removed words put back, and added ones, each on its own color.
msgid "Show changes"
msgstr "Показати зміни"

#. TRANSLATOR: Tooltip of a dimmed reaction in a message's menu; it can still be picked.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1091
msgid "Needs Telegram Premium"
msgstr "Потрібен Telegram Premium"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat error, after a reaction was picked from a message's menu; followed by the reaction.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1115
msgid "Cannot change the reaction"
msgstr "Не вдається змінити реакцію"
